{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1journal", "label": "D1Journal", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Spricht die Cloudflare-D1-REST-API mit dem HTTP-Client des Frameworks - D1 hat kein Node-SDK. Das langsamste Backend pro Operation: jedes Statement ist ein HTTPS-Round-Trip.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1snapshotstore", "label": "D1SnapshotStore", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": null, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1durablestatestore", "label": "D1DurableStateStore", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Durable-State-CAS nutzt INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING zum Anlegen und UPDATE ... WHERE revision = expected zum Aktualisieren, wobei D1s meta.changes als Anzahl betroffener Zeilen gelesen wird.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_no_transactions", "label": "Keine Transaktionen - bedingt durch den Transport", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "D1s HTTP-API bietet ein Statement pro Request: kein BEGIN, kein parametrisierter Batch. Das Journal bleibt korrekt, weil seine Concurrency nie von der Transaktion abhing - Appends sind vom Head aus lueckenlos, zwei einige Writer versuchen dieselbe erste Sequenznummer, und der Verlierer scheitert an seinem ersten Insert. Kosten: reisst die Verbindung mitten in einem Multi-Event-Append, bleiben die geschriebenen Events geschrieben; der Fehler des Callers bedeutet nicht 'nichts wurde geschrieben'.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_verification_gap", "label": "Verifikationsluecke des D1-Backends", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Jedes andere Backend hat eine Live-Integrations-Suite gegen einen echten Server; D1 hat keine und kann derzeit keine haben - es gibt kein Container-Image, lokal existiert es nur in wrangler/Miniflare. Verifiziert sind SQL (via SQLite/libSQL), die Storage-Contracts (gegen einen In-Process-Fake) und das REST-Envelope (gestubbtes fetch). Der Transport - Auth, das Response-Envelope der deployten API, Rate-Limits, Fehlermeldung - ist ungetestet; gegenueber dem echten Service als unbewiesen behandeln.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_maxresponsebytes", "label": "maxResponseBytes", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "readFrom selektiert die gesamte Historie eines Actors in einem Statement, und dieser Transport ist ein Statement pro HTTP-Response - maxResponseBytes begrenzt damit ein ganzes Replay und nicht eine Seite davon. Der Default liegt bei 64 MiB, deutlich ueber den generischen 8 MiB des HttpClient, weil der Peer die eigene Datenbank ist und keine untrusted API.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_zero_dependency", "label": "Backend ohne Paket-Dependency", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Das einzige Backend, das dem Dependency-Baum nichts hinzufuegt - kein Treiber, kein nativer Build, nichts zu auditieren. Das API-Token geht als Bearer-Token raus und wird aus der Umgebung gelesen; nur einen Teil der drei Credentials zu setzen wird beim Verdrahten abgelehnt, weil das fast immer eine vergessene Umgebungsvariable ist.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1journal", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_in_memory_journal", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_no_transactions", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1journal", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_verification_gap", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1journal", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_maxresponsebytes", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1journal", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_zero_dependency", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1journal", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1journal", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_sqlite_sqlitejournal", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1journal", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_libsql_libsqljournal", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_no_transactions", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_mongodb_no_transactions_needed", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1durablestatestore", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_durable_state_durablestateactor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_cloudflare_d1_d1journal", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_journals_in_memory_journalconcurrencyerror", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/journals/cloudflare-d1.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}